WEBVTT

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.931
Please let my best friend,
Otaru Mamiya...

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.774
...return to the path of sanity
from which he has strayed.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:14.811
Dear God, if it's not asking too
much, please of fer Otaru salvation...

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.816
...from the seductions of those
marionette she-devils.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:19.419
Amen!

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.341
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.945
| was born to be with you.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.287
The moment I awoke...

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:58.380
...prisms surrounded me.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.051
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:05.664
I was born to hold you.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.835
Lies and truths...

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:12.963
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.708
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.546
...won't get to me.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:23.040
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:26.644
...can be ours once again!

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:31.253
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:35.090
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:38.495
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:43.230
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.144
As those who already know,
already know...

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:59.174
...the remote planet Terra ll is surely
the smelliest planet in the galaxy.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:03.814
You may look left and right,
but you will find only men.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.724
For some reason, everyone born
from their cloning was male.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:12.560
Now, that wasn't such a great thing,
so they attempted to create androids.

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.828
Naturally, these androids
were modelled after girls.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.302
And, these sweet things
were called...

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.499
...MARIONETTES!

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:27.323
Love Prophesy
Battle Royale

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.124
"Excellent Luck”

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:31.584
"Excellent Luck" "Someone
you've expected. Love thy neighbor.”

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.844
Neighbor-...

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.853
Coming through"

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:40.591
It definitely reads
"Love thy neighbor."

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.628
My neighbor...

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:44.193
You bozos!

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.437
Your fortune is--Love thy neighbor!
Neighbor!

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.787
OTARU!

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:16.087
"Kasahari Apartments”

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:19.029
| see, I see! Is that how it is!

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:20.964
The person I've
been expecting is...

00:03:23.503 --> 00:03:26.632
Now is the time for courage,
Mitsurugi Hanagata!

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.612
Alley-oop!

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:37.146
Hi there, Otaru!
Isn't it a lovely morning?

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.144
Otaru?

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.017
Oh, Otaruuuuu!

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:48.971
The sins of the fathers
are visited upon the sons...

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.827
"Midsummer Haunted House" The sins
of the fathers are visited upon the sons...

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:54.657
These terrifying ghosts will
send shivers down your spine!

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.762
Pay at the exit!

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:09.408
I shall lop off your head
to make my bread!

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:15.015
Could you direct me to the privy?

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:17.456
Privy?

00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:19.992
I need to go so badly...

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:22.762
I can't hold it.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.553
Be strong, be strong!!!
We'll be there soon!

00:04:29.869 --> 00:04:33.396
One... Two...

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:37.836
When she gets to nine,
she'll say she needs one more.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.402
F-Five... Six...

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.538
This is boring. Let's go.

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:42.979
Seven...

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:45.950
Eight... Nine...!

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:52.288
I need one more. I am so sad...

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:57.222
I'm a long-necked goblin!

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:02.034
I'm SCARY!

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:07.129
They look like they're
enjoying themselves.

00:05:07.206 --> 00:05:08.833
This is a good job for them!

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:18.284
Too young.

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:24.813
Loveliness: top of the class!
Chest: somewhat unsatisfactory.

00:05:28.394 --> 00:05:30.192
Very appealing, but no flavor.

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:32.129
What a drooling enthusiast!

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:35.361
Otaru Mamiya's marionettes are,
like, the pick of the crop!

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:37.029
Which one you wanna go for?

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.798
Majority vote, aye!

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:40.339
Like, let's do it!

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:52.851
"Master switch"

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:54.420
Woo-0-o!

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:01.117
Is this part of the act?

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:03.790
M-Master Otaru...!

00:06:11.504 --> 00:06:11.993
Cherry?!

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:14.369
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:06:14.907 --> 00:06:16.375
Cherry! What's wrong?!!

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:18.440
<i>Cherry</i>

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:20.343
"Midsummer Haunted House"

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:25.951
Come back here!!

00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:30.255
I finally found you, Otaru!

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:32.291
L-Leggo, you stupid twit!

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:38.058
I'll never let you go!
Today is our day of destiny!

00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:48.471
<i>Cherry</i>

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:50.509
Yes?

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:53.308
Then... that was LIME...?

00:06:53.379 --> 00:06:55.347
I'll never let you go!

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:13.866
Today marks our 100th
marionette acquisition!

00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:17.597
Like, this makes our marionette
collection complete, and stuff!

00:07:22.175 --> 00:07:23.574
WHAT?!

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:27.445
Huh? Where am I?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.076
Crap! We, like, got the wrong one!

00:07:30.149 --> 00:07:32.015
Oh, no! Shit!

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:35.577
| say! Why did we have to grab the
wrong one at our moment of triumph???

00:07:36.155 --> 00:07:37.782
Where's Otaru?

00:07:37.857 --> 00:07:40.383
Tell me, tell me! Who are you?

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.928
Goblins?

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:45.027
Who you callin' GOBLINS?!

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:48.465
We are marionette collectors so great,
we border on sublime!!!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.038
"Rinzo the 'Core™

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:54.998
"Tenbe the Rare"!

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:56.872
"Densuke the Pure'!

00:07:58.845 --> 00:08:00.813
80, you're thieves?

00:08:02.048 --> 00:08:05.018
WE ARE NOT THIEVES!!
We're like, COLLECTORS, and stuff.

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.453
How is that different?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.783
We have LOVE!

00:08:08.855 --> 00:08:11.950
We acquired these with great effort,
and by being true to ourselves!

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:15.658
That's like, the Collector's Spirit,
and stuff!

00:08:15.862 --> 00:08:18.160
But, it's not nice to steal.

00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:20.489
Like, how would you
know?! And stuff!

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:23.367
I don't.
| don't know about you.

00:08:23.436 --> 00:08:25.530
| say! Don't you think she
talks back too much?

00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:29.337
Like, what the hell kind of program
did Otaru Mamiya put into you?!

00:08:30.076 --> 00:08:31.407
Well...

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:36.313
Me and Otaru and Cherry and Bloodberry
live together like best friends!

00:08:37.917 --> 00:08:40.978
Marionettes living like the best
of friends with humans, you say?!

00:08:41.487 --> 00:08:43.819
She's totally screwed up! Crazy!

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:54.792
You're looking at me dirty.
I don't like you.

00:08:56.135 --> 00:08:58.797
Hmph! Well, we don't like you either!

00:08:58.871 --> 00:09:02.034
Like, we like proper
young ladies, and stuff!

00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:04.938
Not flat-nosed runts like you!

00:09:09.515 --> 00:09:12.917
You, you, you!
Like, how dare you, and stuff!

00:09:20.826 --> 00:09:23.989
Like, we know every weak point
a marionette has, and stuff!

00:09:40.146 --> 00:09:41.614
HOW DARE YOU!

00:09:43.549 --> 00:09:45.017
Stop it!

00:09:46.519 --> 00:09:49.921
Like, don't disobey your human
superiors, you lowly marionette!

00:09:55.895 --> 00:09:57.294
Put me down!!

00:10:07.406 --> 00:10:09.374
| failed to protect her.

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:13.268
Lime...!

00:10:14.046 --> 00:10:15.514
| can't stand this.

00:10:15.581 --> 00:10:18.346
He searched for her all day.

00:10:18.417 --> 00:10:21.682
Poor, gentle Master Otaru...
He's deeply hurt.

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:28.122
There's nothing left, but for me
to soothe his aching heart!

00:10:29.829 --> 00:10:31.820
- Stop copying me!
- YOU stop copying ME!

00:10:31.897 --> 00:10:33.922
-I won't be beaten!
- Neither will I

00:10:36.002 --> 00:10:37.436
Dammit!

00:10:39.472 --> 00:10:40.962
Stop right there, Otaru!

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.304
Let go! I have to save Lime!!

00:10:43.676 --> 00:10:48.011
Leave that sort of thing to
the police! They handle thefts.

00:10:48.681 --> 00:10:50.979
Thefts?! It's not like that!
Lime's not a--

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:54.384
It's a THEFT.
Marionettes are THINGS!

00:10:54.453 --> 00:10:56.421
They are machines, not humans!

00:10:56.922 --> 00:10:57.889
But, still!

00:10:57.957 --> 00:10:59.982
Calm down, Otaru...

00:11:00.059 --> 00:11:03.825
Surely, you're not suggesting
that you love those marionettes?

00:11:03.896 --> 00:11:05.022
Love?!

00:11:05.097 --> 00:11:08.260
It's not like that. I just...

00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:10.928
Otaru...

00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:12.630
YOU ARE GRAVELY MISTAKEN!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:18.902
Love is a sublime miracle wrought by
harmonized words and passionate hearts!

00:11:18.978 --> 00:11:22.642
Hot sparks of life seeking other life,
quarrelling and fighting for supremacy!

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:26.716
Man was destined to coexist with man
since the creation of Heaven and Earth!

00:11:26.786 --> 00:11:27.810
Otaru...!

00:11:27.887 --> 00:11:29.651
Marionettes are,
after all, machines.

00:11:29.722 --> 00:11:33.454
It would be impossible to belong
with them, let alone LOVE them!

00:11:33.893 --> 00:11:36.760
There's someone out there
who is better for you...

00:11:36.829 --> 00:11:38.661
And, you know...
You know what?

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:40.465
That someone is ME!

00:11:43.569 --> 00:11:44.934
Master Otaru?

00:11:45.004 --> 00:11:46.848
I made you some
delicious iced noodles...!

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:49.341
Oh? Master Otaru?

00:11:49.408 --> 00:11:52.969
| wonder where he went?
I could swear I just heard voices...

00:11:53.045 --> 00:11:54.479
Hey, Otaru!

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:57.539
This says that Atamiis THE place
for a sentimental journey!

00:11:57.616 --> 00:11:59.209
Oh? Where's Otaru?

00:11:59.285 --> 00:12:01.185
I can't find him either.

00:12:01.253 --> 00:12:03.221
Maybe he went out to
look for her again...

00:12:09.095 --> 00:12:11.063
| just...| just...!

00:12:37.556 --> 00:12:39.354
Oh, sorry!

00:12:42.862 --> 00:12:45.422
Are you suggesting that
you love that marionette?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.531
You are gravely mistaken!!!

00:12:49.602 --> 00:12:50.899
Welcome

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:53.530
It is a theft.
Marionettes are marionettes!

00:12:53.973 --> 00:12:56.738
They are machine, not man.
Am I wrong?

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:59.806
Am I fooling myself...?

00:12:59.879 --> 00:13:02.177
Is it strange for me
to worry about Lime like this?

00:13:07.253 --> 00:13:08.721
If it isn't Otaru!

00:13:10.389 --> 00:13:11.754
Master!

00:13:13.893 --> 00:13:15.987
Do you think there's
something wrong with me?

00:13:16.061 --> 00:13:20.498
Yeah, I know she's a marionette...
Am I a fool to worry about her?

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:24.660
Lime is the marionette
that defeated me, yes?

00:13:31.043 --> 00:13:32.272
Otaru...

00:13:32.344 --> 00:13:34.938
Man decided what normality was.

00:13:35.014 --> 00:13:37.813
One's values are
for oneself to decide.

00:13:37.883 --> 00:13:40.875
See with your own eyes,
and think for yourself.

00:13:40.953 --> 00:13:43.945
When you begin to go astray,
try to return to your starting point.

00:14:00.506 --> 00:14:02.702
Maybe you would understand...

00:14:21.727 --> 00:14:22.956
Lime...!!

00:14:23.028 --> 00:14:24.996
Please press the button.

00:14:25.531 --> 00:14:26.007
"Fortune-telling Machine”

00:14:26.031 --> 00:14:29.001
"Fortune-telling Machine” - What...?
- Please press the button.

00:14:29.568 --> 00:14:31.536
Please press the button.

00:14:37.543 --> 00:14:39.477
"Plunge ahead for good fortune.”

00:14:39.745 --> 00:14:42.339
"Love is the most beautiful
disease in the world."

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.348
Plunge ahead for good fortune.

00:14:47.853 --> 00:14:49.582
Plunge ahead for good fortune!

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.358
RIGHT!

00:14:57.897 --> 00:14:59.365
Plunge ahead for good fortune!

00:15:02.434 --> 00:15:03.902
Master Otaru!

00:15:04.937 --> 00:15:06.405
We received this!

00:15:07.072 --> 00:15:10.702
"We took the wrong one.
If you don't want--"

00:15:12.945 --> 00:15:15.209
"--To be destroyed, bring--"

00:15:17.549 --> 00:15:21.349
"--To the Nanakubi Temple.
Come alone, got it?"

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.749
Those bastards...!

00:15:22.821 --> 00:15:27.315
They were actually after
sweet, little old me...?

00:15:27.393 --> 00:15:30.328
- Otaru!! - You two, stay put! I'm going alone!
- But I would go through any ordeal...

00:15:30.562 --> 00:15:32.121
- What're you going to do?!
- ..for you, Master Otaru!

00:15:34.033 --> 00:15:36.092
Yes! I would!

00:15:36.168 --> 00:15:40.503
Oh, please...! "You're the best,
Cherry"? Oh, the joy!

00:15:41.006 --> 00:15:43.236
Oh... Master Otaru...
People are watching...

00:15:43.309 --> 00:15:45.277
You mustn't! You mustn't!

00:15:48.747 --> 00:15:50.374
| say, do you think he'll come?

00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:51.917
Definitely, absolutely!

00:15:55.521 --> 00:15:56.750
He'll come.

00:15:56.822 --> 00:16:00.520
And then, we'll, like, pay him back
back for what she did to my hand!

00:16:01.427 --> 00:16:02.895
Right, Master?

00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:07.456
Like, we're prepared
for anything, and stuff.

00:16:07.533 --> 00:16:08.932
He's here!

00:16:13.973 --> 00:16:16.943
You stinking bastards!
What are you doing to Lime?!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.242
|- say! He came empty-handed!

00:16:20.312 --> 00:16:23.077
Like, where's the marionette
you were supposed to bring us?!

00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:24.877
NOWHERE!

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:28.079
You creeps better release Lime
quick, or you'll regret it!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.648
| don't like ones
like her, anyways!

00:16:30.956 --> 00:16:33.152
She's disobedient, noisy...

00:16:33.525 --> 00:16:35.391
Oh! Like, I get it!"

00:16:35.461 --> 00:16:38.328
You don't want to part with
your super-cute marionette, do you?

00:16:38.397 --> 00:16:40.923
As a fellow enthusiast,
| can understand that completely.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.490
It's such a difficult
decision, and all!

00:16:42.901 --> 00:16:44.369
It's not like that!!

00:16:44.436 --> 00:16:48.464
Like, I know! I'll give you 100 ryo
to exchange her for the other one!

00:16:56.115 --> 00:16:58.982
| should mention that these
are actual Gartlant Army parts...

00:16:59.051 --> 00:17:01.816
...that my daddy picked
up for me, see?!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.328
Well! I say, are you
going to go get her?

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.463
I'm not going to take orders
from crackpots like you!

00:17:14.967 --> 00:17:16.696
Let's see what
you got, scumbait!

00:17:16.969 --> 00:17:18.368
My God!

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:26.740
Huh?!

00:17:28.647 --> 00:17:30.615
Master! Master!

00:17:36.055 --> 00:17:39.719
"Nemuri” is my surname...
...but I am known as Tanzen.

00:17:46.165 --> 00:17:49.829
The carnal desires of the night have
awakened Masamune's thirst for blood.

00:17:51.236 --> 00:17:53.432
You go get him, Master!

00:17:53.505 --> 00:17:56.065
Like, bash him up until
he's lumpy, and stuff!

00:18:07.986 --> 00:18:11.889
This is yet another example of the
cruel fate the transient world holds.

00:18:21.533 --> 00:18:23.661
He's making the edge of his sword
look bigger thanit is...

00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:29.096
| won't let him beat me!

00:18:31.677 --> 00:18:34.009
I'll save you, I swear!

00:18:37.549 --> 00:18:40.849
| don't care what anybody says,
I'll walk my own path!!

00:18:44.857 --> 00:18:46.052
Plunge ahead for good fortune!

00:18:47.092 --> 00:18:48.560
Otaru!!

00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:57.364
| wasn't through posing yet.."

00:18:58.036 --> 00:18:59.765
That wasn't fair.

00:19:03.142 --> 00:19:04.974
He got the Master!

00:19:17.089 --> 00:19:19.615
It was a joke...
It was just a funny joke...

00:19:20.526 --> 00:19:21.857
Okay?

00:19:21.927 --> 00:19:23.918
Do you think you'll get
out of it that easy?

00:19:25.664 --> 00:19:26.927
Hurry up!!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.295
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:30.369 --> 00:19:32.599
I know! Would you like
something from my collection?

00:19:33.038 --> 00:19:37.999
This is a '76 model! Or, like,
would you prefer a Jingoro model?

00:19:39.411 --> 00:19:40.879
Well?

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.478
KNOCK IT OFF!

00:19:56.094 --> 00:19:57.562
Lime!

00:19:59.731 --> 00:20:01.859
The world is spinning around...

00:20:01.934 --> 00:20:03.959
Will you be okay, Lime?

00:20:04.036 --> 00:20:05.800
I'll be fine!

00:20:05.871 --> 00:20:07.862
Yeah, you're a toughie.

00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:18.684
Hey, Otaru...?

00:20:19.751 --> 00:20:22.721
Is it strange for
us to be friends?

00:20:23.622 --> 00:20:25.090
No, it's not!

00:20:25.991 --> 00:20:28.961
Even if the world says otherwise,
it's not strange at all"

00:20:29.928 --> 00:20:31.396
Yeah!

00:20:34.499 --> 00:20:37.230
"Kasahari Apartments”
OTARU! LET'S GO PLAY

00:20:37.669 --> 00:20:40.001
Master Otaru,
here's your breakfast!

00:20:40.372 --> 00:20:42.864
Hey, Otaru! Let's go to Atami!

00:20:42.941 --> 00:20:45.273
Otaru's MINE!

00:20:45.344 --> 00:20:49.042
Ow, ow! Okay!
I'll eat, I'll go, I'll play"

00:20:50.449 --> 00:20:51.917
Leggo already!

00:21:02.961 --> 00:21:04.929
He loves me, he loves me not.

00:21:05.664 --> 00:21:07.393
Loves me, loves me not...

00:21:07.966 --> 00:21:09.957
...loves me, loves me not.

00:21:10.035 --> 00:21:11.400
Loves me...!

00:21:12.638 --> 00:21:14.606
Loves me not.

00:21:15.974 --> 00:21:18.534
But, Otaru!"!
| won't let it get to me!

00:21:19.044 --> 00:21:21.513
I'll bring you to your senses!

00:21:21.913 --> 00:21:25.281
I, Mitsurugi Hanagata,
would gladly die for you!

00:21:44.536 --> 00:21:48.302
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:48.373 --> 00:21:52.003
...don't go off to be alone.

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:55.114
Just think of me...

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:59.674
...and I'll be there with you.

00:21:59.951 --> 00:22:03.649
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:03.722 --> 00:22:07.386
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:07.592 --> 00:22:11.324
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:11.396 --> 00:22:13.057
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:13.131 --> 00:22:17.159
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:19.237 --> 00:22:21.638
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:21.707 --> 00:22:26.645
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:26.812 --> 00:22:30.305
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:30.682 --> 00:22:34.243
...one step at a time.

00:22:34.486 --> 00:22:38.184
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:38.256 --> 00:22:41.954
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:45.858
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:46.064 --> 00:22:52.026
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:01.079 --> 00:23:02.513
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:02.581 --> 00:23:04.913
They say that Gartlant
has begun a war!

00:23:04.983 --> 00:23:07.645
Hey, Otaru? What's a "war"?

00:23:07.719 --> 00:23:09.915
Is it something that
takes loved ones away?

00:23:09.988 --> 00:23:13.549
No way! I don't
want to lose Otaru!

00:23:13.625 --> 00:23:18.119
I'm going to Gartland! I'm going
to tell Faust to stop the war!

00:23:19.097 --> 00:23:24.345
If We All Go To Gartlant Together, It won't
Be So Scary Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:24.369 --> 00:23:26.064
If We All Go To Gartlant Together, It
won't Be So Scary I love you, Otaru!!
